roles-antag-blood-brother-name = Blood Brother
roles-antag-blood-brother-objective = Work as a pair, eliminate your shared target, and leave the station alive and free.

blood-brother-role-greeting =
    You hate Nanotrasen, and the corporation has given you plenty of reasons for it. The Syndicate offers the best opportunity to fight back, so you and your partner, who shares the same feelings, contacted them to join their ranks. Now you are Blood Brothers, and you are ready to do anything for your common goal.
    Your partner is {$brother}.

blood-brother-role-greeting-solo =
    You hate Nanotrasen, and the corporation has given you plenty of reasons for it. The Syndicate offers the best opportunity to fight back, so you contacted them to join their ranks. For now you are operating without a partner, but you are ready to do anything for your goal.

blood-brother-briefing = You are bound by a blood oath to another agent. Your objectives are shared, so work together and do not abandon your partner.
blood-brother-round-end-agent-name = blood brother
blood-brother-partner-objective-title = Your partner: {$targetName}